<BaseLayout title="Contact | Vincenzo's Fish & Chips Van" description="Contact Vincenzo's Fish & Chips Van for public stops, events, weddings, gala days and private bookings.">
<section class="page-hero hero-compact"><div class="container"><div class="kicker">Vincenzo & Giuliana</div><h1 class="page-title">Contact Us</h1><p class="lead">For events, weddings, care homes, gala days, corporate catering, public stops and private celebrations.</p></div></section>

<section class="section"><div class="container contact-grid">
